# Developer documentation is kept on the maintainer's machine only: every Markdown file
# is private except the root README and the user documentation. The tests and check-docs
# skip the developer-documentation checks when it is absent, so a public clone still
# passes `pnpm test`.
*.md
!/README.md
!/docs/user-docs.md
# NOT documentation: the orchestrator's system prompt is read by the code at runtime.
# Ignoring it would break the orchestrator in every clone.
!/packages/ops-orchestrator/src/prompts/system.md

# Early local leftovers, not part of the project: the first sketch and a spike script.
/scheme.txt
/packages/ops-projects/.p6.mts

# The pricing dataset as downloaded; the copy Argus uses is in packages/ops-meter/catalog/.
/ai-api-pricing.csv

# Child scripts the crash tests write next to themselves; removed after each test.
.child-*/

# Local archive of superseded private docs
/hist/
